##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene A white sphere under a white dome, which is white wherever it is seen
version 3.03
Format 64 64 1
PixelSamples 8 8
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.01 100
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Light "PxrDomeLight" "sky"
Color [1 1 1]
Surface "matte"
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
